+/* On Mikros the connection is a kernel channel. Each channel message holds
+ * whole Wayland messages, at most CHANNEL_BYTES bytes, with the handles of
+ * their file descriptor arguments, at most CHANNEL_HANDLES, in order.
+ * Received handles become descriptors of the kind that their object type
